<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36351" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pinguēdo</span></b> , ĭnis,
			f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>fatness</i>, <i>fat</i> (post-Aug.), <i><span class="en">Plin. 12,
				15, 35, § 68</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Pall. 3,
			29</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11, 20</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 2,
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>richness</i>, <i>abundance</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. Gen.
				27, 28</span></i>; id. Job, 36, 16.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b> Fig., <i>fulness</i>,
				<i>richness</i> in expression (opp. exilitas), v.
			l. ap. <i><span class="en">Quint. 1, 11, 4</span></i> (al.
		pinguetudine).</div>
